                // Projects
        section#projects.projects-section
            .container.px-4.px-lg-5
                .text-center
                    // Finished Project Row
                    h1.text-white Finished Projects
                h4.text-white-50.mb-0 Projects I have completed in the past:

                // Project One Row
                .row.gx-0.mb-5.mb-lg-0.justify-content-center
                    .col-lg-6
                        img.img-fluid(src='assets/img/gpstracker.png', alt='bike gps tracker')
                    .col-lg-6
                        .text-center.h-100.project
                            .d-flex.h-100
                                .project-text.w-100.my-auto.text-center.text-lg-left
                                    h4.text-white Bike Tracker
                                    p.mb-0.text-white-50
                                        | The bike tracker is a project idea that I developed about three years ago out of necessity. The reason for this was a theft on my bike, where the bike computer and the headlight were removed from the handlebars. Since the market currently offers only alarm system or GPS tracker, but not the combination of both, I have developed the whole thing myself, which can be monitored via an app.
                                    a.btn.btn-primary Learn more - page in progress
                                    //a.btn.btn-primary(href='gpsbiketracker.html') Learn more - page in progress
                // Project Two Row
                .row.gx-0.justify-content-center
                    .col-lg-6
                        img.img-fluid(src='assets/img/magic-mirror.jpg', alt='Magic-Mirror')
                    .col-lg-6.order-lg-first
                        .text-center.h-100.project
                            .d-flex.h-100
                                .project-text.w-100.my-auto.text-center.text-lg-right
                                    h4.text-white Magic Mirror
                                    p.mb-0.text-white-50
                                        | The Magic Mirror project is a very extensive but also a flexible project with endless possibilities. I use the project to be informed about important dates, events and news and to start the day with nice sayings.
                                    a.btn.btn-primary Learn more - page in progress
                                    //a.btn.btn-primary(href='magicmirror.html') Learn more - page in progress
                // Project Three Row
                .row.gx-0.mb-5.mb-lg-0.justify-content-center
                    .col-lg-6
