                                    p.mb-0.text-white-50
                                        | Home Assistant is an open-source platform that allows users to create a centralized and customizable smart home system by integrating and automating various devices and services. HomeAssistant runs on a Raspberry Pi IV.
                                    a.btn.btn-primary Learn more - page in progress
                                    //a.btn.btn-primary(href='homeassistant.html') Learn more - page in progress
                // Project Five Row
                .row.gx-0.mb-5.mb-lg-0.justify-content-center
