        section#projects.projects-section
            .container.px-4.px-lg-5
                .text-center
                    h1.text-white Current Projects
                h4.text-white-50.mb-0 I am currently working on these projects:

                // Project One Row
                .row.gx-0.mb-5.mb-lg-0.justify-content-center
                    .col-lg-6
                        img.img-fluid(src='assets/img/cryptotrading-bot.png', alt='Crypto trading bot')
                    .col-lg-6
                        .text-center.h-100.project
                            .d-flex.h-100
                                .project-text.w-100.my-auto.text-center.text-lg-left
                                    h4.text-white Crypto Trading Bot
                                    p.mb-0.text-white-50
                                        | Through Corona, more and more people are thinking about how best to invest their money. Many investors invest in shares or crypto, which is becoming more and more popular and can also generate good profits (see also my article "How I currently earn money with crypto in addition to my studies"). In doing so, you have to choose a balancing act between security and profit that is ideal for you. Since for many already trading with crypto is a great mystery and you yourself do not know exactly how much and when to invest in an Altcoin, is a great uncertainty for many. Unlike stocks, you also have to react faster to price fluctuations (usually within a few hours). The crypto trading bot offers the ideal solution here. It should monitor the changes of the last few days for the deposited crypto coins and buy or sell when the price is low.
                                    a.btn.btn-primary Learn more - page in progress
                                    //a.btn.btn-primary(href='cryptotradingbot.html') Learn more
