                                .project-text.w-100.my-auto.text-center.text-lg-right
                                    h4.text-white Radar recognition
                                    p.mb-0.text-white-50
                                        | It is not yet completely clear what the concrete use case should be here. Basically, however, object recognition is to be realized. For example, the automated opening of a garage door would be conceivable.
                                    a.btn.btn-primary Learn more - page in progress
                                    //a.btn.btn-primary(href='radarrecognition.html') Learn more
